'''Ilima''' (Japanese: '''イリマ''' ''Ilima'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Put 1 of your {{e|Colorless}} Pokémon that has damage on it into your hand.
}}

