==Trivia==
* This card's effect is identical to that of {{TCG|Cheren's Care}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].
** {{TCG|Ilima}} also exists in the Pokémon Trading Card Game, but with a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Ilima]] is a [[Trial Captain|captain]] in the [[Generation VII]] [[Pokémon games]]. The [[Verdant Cavern]] is featured in the uncommon illustration.

